  <name>Photo Organizer</name>
  <summary>Organize your photos by EXIF date</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      Photo Organizer is a simple tool to help you organize your photo collection.
      It reads the EXIF date from your images and copies them into a structured
      folder hierarchy (e.g., Year/Month/Day).
    </p>
    <p>
      The application always uses EXIF data when available and scans the source
      folder recursively, including all subdirectories.
    </p>
  </description>

  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.giuseppecigala.PhotoOrganizer.desktop</launchable>

